              "id": 16574038,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Android 12\nFirefox version: Firefox Nightly 119.0a1 (2015972515-\ud83e\udd8e119.0a1-20230905215534\ud83e\udd8e\n\n**Preconditions:** \nClean profile\n\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to : https://vimeo.com/598881804\n2. Perform account login.\n3. Play a video.\n4. Observe the video player options.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nPiP is present\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nPiP is missing\n\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproducible regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproducible on the latest build of Firefox Nightly and Release\n- Works as expected using Chrome\n- Screenshot attached\n- Issue found during WebCompat team [Top100] websites testing",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "Created attachment 9352689\nScreenshot_1.png\n\n**Environment:**\nOperating system: Android 12\nFirefox version: Firefox Nightly 119.0a1 (2015972515-\ud83e\udd8e119.0a1-20230905215534\ud83e\udd8e\n\n**Preconditions:** \nClean profile\n\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to : https://vimeo.com/598881804\n2. Perform account login.\n3. Play a video.\n4. Observe the video player options.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nPiP is present\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nPiP is missing\n\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproducible regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproducible on the latest build of Firefox Nightly and Release\n- Works as expected using Chrome\n- Screenshot attached\n- Issue found during WebCompat team [Top100] websites testing",
              "time": "2023-09-12T13:50:01Z"
